\" id=\"mwAS0\">[</span>61<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwAS4\">]</span></span></a></sup></li>\n<li><span data-sort-value=\"Washington04 !\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Washington's_4th_congressional_district\" title=\"Washington's 4th congressional district\">Washington<span typeof=\"mw:Entity\"> </span>4</a></span>: <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dan_Newhouse\" title=\"Dan Newhouse\">Dan Newhouse</a> is retiring.<sup about=\"#mwt268\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-Newhouse_66-0\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"Newhouse\"},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-Newhouse-66\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-Newhouse-66\" id=\"mwAS8\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwATA\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwATE\">[</span>62<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwATI\">]</span></span></a></sup></li>\n<li><span data-sort-value=\"Wisconsin07 !\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wisconsin's_7th_congressional_district\" title=\"Wisconsin's 7th congressional district\">Wisconsin<span typeof=\"mw:Entity\"> </span>7</a></span>: <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tom_Tiffany\" title=\"Tom Tiffany\">Tom Tiffany</a> is retiring to <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026_Wisconsin_gubernatorial_election\" title=\"2026 Wisconsin gubernatorial election\">run for governor of Wisconsin</a>.<sup about=\"#mwt272\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-TomTiffany_67-0\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"TomTiffany\"},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-TomTiffany-67\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-TomTiffany-67\" id=\"mwATM\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwATQ\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwATU\">[</span>63<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwATY\">]</span></span></a></sup></li>\n<li><span data-sort-value=\"WyomingAL !\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wyoming's_at-large_congressional_district\" title=\"Wyoming's at-large congressional district\">Wyoming<span typeof=\"mw:Entity\"> </span>at-large</a></span>: <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Harriet_Hageman\" title=\"Harriet Hageman\">Harriet Hageman</a> is retiring to <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026_United_States_Senate_election_in_Wyoming\" title=\"2026 United States Senate election in Wyoming\">run for the U.S. Senate</a>.<sup about=\"#mwt276\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-Hageman_68-0\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"Hageman\"},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-Hageman-68\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-Hageman-68\" id=\"mwATc\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwATg\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwATk\">[</span>64<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwATo\">]</span></span></a></sup></li></ol>\n</div>\n\n</section></section><section data-mw-section-id=\"5\" id=\"mwATs\" aria-labelledby=\"Nomination_withdrawn\"><div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Nomination_withdrawn\">Nomination withdrawn</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=2026_United_States_House_of_Representatives_elections&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Nomination withdrawn\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p id=\"mwATw\">One Republican was originally won re-nomination but withdrew after the primary.<sup about=\"#mwt280\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-:7_69-0\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\":7\"},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-:7-69\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-:7-69\" id=\"mwAT0\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwAT4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwAT8\">[</span>65<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwAUA\">]</span></span></a></sup><sup about=\"#mwt281\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-Edwards_70-0\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"Edwards\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-Edwards-70\" id=\"mwAUE\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwAUI\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwAUM\">[</span>66<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwAUQ\">]</span></span></a></sup><sup about=\"#mwt284\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-:8_71-0\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\":8\"},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-:8-71\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-:8-71\" id=\"mwAUU\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwAUY\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwAUc\">[</span>67<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwAUg\">]</span></span></a></sup></p>\n\n<section data-mw-section-id=\"6\" id=\"mwAUk\" aria-labelledby=\"Republican_2\"><div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Republican_2\">Republican</h3><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=2026_United_States_House_of_Representatives_elections&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Republican\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<ol id=\"mwAUo\"><li id=\"mwAUs\"><span data-sort-value=\"North Carolina11 !\" about=\"#mwt285\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" id=\"mwAUw\" data-mw='{\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"ushr\",\"href\":\"./Template:Ushr\"},\"params\":{\"1\":{\"wt\":\"NC\"},\"2\":{\"wt\":\"11\"},\"3\":{\"wt\":\"X\"}},\"i\":0}}]}'><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/North_Carolina's_11th_congressional_district\" title=\"North Carolina's 11th congressional district\">North Carolina<span typeof=\"mw:Entity\"> </span>11</a></span>: <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chuck_Edwards\" title=\"Chuck Edwards\" id=\"mwAU0\">Chuck Edwards</a> won the Republican primary on March 3, 2026,<sup about=\"#mwt286\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-:7_69-1\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\":7\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-:7-69\" id=\"mwAU4\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwAU8\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwAVA\">[</span>65<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwAVE\">]</span></span></a></sup> but withdrew on August 5 following a censure.<sup about=\"#mwt289\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-Edwards_70-1\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"Edwards\"},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-Edwards-70\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-Edwards-70\" id=\"mwAVI\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwAVM\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwAVQ\">[</span>66<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwAVU\">]</span></span></a></sup><sup about=\"#mwt290\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-:8_71-1\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\":8\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-:8-71\" id=\"mwAVY\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwAVc\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwAVg\">[</span>67<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwAVk\">]</span></span></a></sup></li></ol>\n\n</section></section><section data-mw-section-id=\"7\" id=\"mwAVo\" aria-labelledby=\"Resignations\"><div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Resignations\">Resignations</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=2026_United_States_House_of_Representatives_elections&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Resignations\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p id=\"mwAVs\">Two seats will be left vacant on the day of the general election until the next Congress due to resignations.</p>\n\n<section data-mw-section-id=\"8\" id=\"mwAVw\" aria-labelledby=\"Democratic_2\"><div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Democratic_2\">Democratic</h3><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=2026_United_States_House_of_Representatives_elections&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Democratic\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<ol id=\"mwAV0\"><li id=\"mwAV4\"><span data-sort-value=\"Florida20 !\" about=\"#mwt291\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" id=\"mwAV8\" data-mw='{\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"ushr\",\"href\":\"./Template:Ushr\"},\"params\":{\"1\":{\"wt\":\"FL\"},\"2\":{\"wt\":\"20\"},\"3\":{\"wt\":\"X\"}},\"i\":0}}]}'><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Florida's_20th_congressional_district\" title=\"Florida's 20th congressional district\">Florida<span typeof=\"mw:Entity\"> </span>20</a></span>: <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sheila_Cherfilus-McCormick\" title=\"Sheila Cherfilus-McCormick\" id=\"mwAWA\">Sheila Cherfilus-McCormick</a> resigned on April 21, 2026, following money laundering allegations.<sup about=\"#mwt294\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-SCM_72-0\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"SCM\"},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-SCM-72\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-SCM-72\" id=\"mwAWE\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwAWI\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwAWM\">[</span>68<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwAWQ\">]</span></span></a></sup></li></ol>\n\n</section><section data-mw-section-id=\"9\" id=\"mwAWU\" aria-labelledby=\"Republican_3\"><div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Republican_3\">Republican</h3><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=2026_United_States_House_of_Representatives_elections&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Republican\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<ol id=\"mwAWY\"><li id=\"mwAWc\"><span data-sort-value=\"Texas23 !\" about=\"#mwt295\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" id=\"mwAWg\" data-mw='{\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"ushr\",\"href\":\"./Template:Ushr\"},\"params\":{\"1\":{\"wt\":\"TX\"},\"2\":{\"wt\":\"23\"},\"3\":{\"wt\":\"X\"}},\"i\":0}}]}'><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Texas's_23rd_congressional_district\" title=\"Texas's 23rd congressional district\">Texas<span typeof=\"mw:Entity\"> </span>23</a></span>: <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tony_Gonzales\" title=\"Tony Gonzales\" id=\"mwAWk\">Tony Gonzales</a> resigned on April 14, 2026, after admitting to an affair.<sup about=\"#mwt298\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-Gonzales_73-0\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"Gonzales\"},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-Gonzales-73\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-Gonzales-73\" id=\"mwAWo\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwAWs\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwAWw\">[</span>69<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwAW0\">]</span></span></a></sup></li></ol>\n\n</section></section><section data-mw-section-id=\"10\" id=\"mwAW4\" aria-labelledby=\"Incumbents_defeated\"><div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Incumbents_defeated\">Incumbents defeated</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=2026_United_States_House_of_Representatives_elections&amp;action=edit&amp;section=10\" title=\"Edit section: Incumbents defeated\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<section data-mw-section-id=\"11\" id=\"mwAW8\" aria-labelledby=\"In_primary_elections\"><div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"In_primary_elections\">In primary elections</h3><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=2026_United_States_House_of_Representatives_elections&amp;action=edit&amp;section=11\" title=\"Edit section: In primary elections\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<section data-mw-section-id=\"12\" id=\"mwAXA\" aria-labelledby=\"Democrats\"><div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading4\"><h4 id=\"Democrats\">Democrats</h4><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=2026_United_States_House_of_Representatives_elections&amp;action=edit&amp;section=12\" title=\"Edit section: Democrats\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p id=\"mwAXE\">Seven Democrats lost renomination.</p>\n<ol id=\"mwAXI\"><li id=\"mwAXM\"><span data-sort-value=\"Colorado01 !\" about=\"#mwt299\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" id=\"mwAXQ\" data-mw='{\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"ushr\",\"href\":\"./Template:Ushr\"},\"params\":{\"1\":{\"wt\":\"CO\"},\"2\":{\"wt\":\"1\"},\"3\":{\"wt\":\"X\"}},\"i\":0}}]}'><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Colorado's_1st_congressional_district\" title=\"Colorado's 1st congressional district\">Colorado<span typeof=\"mw:Entity\"> </span>1</a></span>: <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Diana_DeGette\" title=\"Diana DeGette\" id=\"mwAXU\">Diana DeGette</a> lost renomination to <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Melat_Kiros\" title=\"Melat Kiros\" id=\"mwAXY\">Melat Kiros</a>.<sup about=\"#mwt302\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-74\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-7