t;span about=\\\"#mwt389\\\" typeof=\\\"mw:Transclusion\\\" id=\\\"mwAjw\\\" data-mw=&apos;{\\\"parts\\\":[{\\\"template\\\":{\\\"target\\\":{\\\"wt\\\":\\\"Party shading/Democratic\\\",\\\"href\\\":\\\"./Template:Party_shading/Democratic\\\"},\\\"params\\\":{},\\\"i\\\":0}}]}&apos;>style=\\\"color:black;background-color:&lt;/span>&lt;span typeof=\\\"mw:Nowiki\\\" about=\\\"#mwt389\\\">&lt;/span>&lt;span about=\\\"#mwt389\\\">#B0CEFF\\\"&lt;/span>\"},{\"html\":\"\"}]]}'><b id=\"mwAj4\">50.4%</b></td>\n<td id=\"mwAj8\">7.4%</td>\n<td style=\"color:black;background-color:#B0CEFF\" about=\"#mwt393\" typeof=\"mw:ExpandedAttrs\" id=\"mwAkE\" data-mw='{\"attribs\":[[{\"txt\":\"style\",\"html\":\"&lt;span about=\\\"#mwt392\\\" typeof=\\\"mw:Transclusion\\\" id=\\\"mwAkA\\\" data-mw=&apos;{\\\"parts\\\":[{\\\"template\\\":{\\\"target\\\":{\\\"wt\\\":\\\"Party shading/Democratic\\\",\\\"href\\\":\\\"./Template:Party_shading/Democratic\\\"},\\\"params\\\":{},\\\"i\\\":0}}]}&apos;>style=\\\"color:black;background-color:&lt;/span>&lt;span typeof=\\\"mw:Nowiki\\\" about=\\\"#mwt392\\\">&lt;/span>&lt;span about=\\\"#mwt392\\\">#B0CEFF\\\"&lt;/span>\"},{\"html\":\"\"}]]}'><b id=\"mwAkI\">Democrats +8.2%</b></td></tr>\n<tr class=\"mw-empty-elt\" id=\"mwAkM\"></tr>\n</tbody></table><link typeof=\"mw:Extension/section\" about=\"#mwt394\" id=\"mwAkQ\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"section\",\"attrs\":{\"end\":\"GenericBallotAgg\"}}'/>\n\n</section><section data-mw-section-id=\"15\" id=\"mwAkU\" aria-labelledby=\"Crossover_seats\"><div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Crossover_seats\">Crossover seats</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=2026_United_States_House_of_Representatives_elections&amp;action=edit&amp;section=15\" title=\"Edit section: Crossover seats\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p id=\"mwAkY\">This is a list of congressional seats that voted for one party in the <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2024_United_States_presidential_election\" title=\"2024 United States presidential election\" id=\"mwAkc\">2024 presidential election</a> and another in the <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2024_United_States_House_of_Representatives_elections\" title=\"2024 United States House of Representatives elections\" id=\"mwAkg\">2024 House elections</a>.<sup about=\"#mwt397\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-91\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-91\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-91\" id=\"mwAkk\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwAko\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwAks\">[</span>86<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwAkw\">]</span></span></a></sup></p>\n\n<section data-mw-section-id=\"16\" id=\"mwAk0\" aria-labelledby=\"Democratic_3\"><div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Democratic_3\">Democratic</h3><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=2026_United_States_House_of_Representatives_elections&amp;action=edit&amp;section=16\" title=\"Edit section: Democratic\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p id=\"mwAk4\">There were originally 13 districts which <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Donald_Trump\" title=\"Donald Trump\" id=\"mwAk8\">Donald Trump</a> won in 2024 that are represented by Democrats. This table only includes the 11 remaining after mid-decade redistricting. Four of these districts were already won by Trump but were made more Republican-leaning through redistricting.<sup about=\"#mwt400\" class=\"mw-ref reference\" id=\"cite_ref-:3_92-0\" rel=\"dc:references\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/ref\" data-mw='{\"name\":\"ref\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\":3\"},\"body\":{\"id\":\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-:3-92\"}}'><a href=\"#cite_note-:3-92\" id=\"mwAlA\"><span class=\"mw-reflink-text\" id=\"mwAlE\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwAlI\">[</span>87<span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"mwAlM\">]</span></span></a></sup></p>\n\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" id=\"mwAlQ\">\n<tbody id=\"mwAlU\"><tr id=\"mwAlY\"><th id=\"mwAlc\">District</th>\n<th colspan=\"6\" id=\"mwAlg\">Incumbent</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"vertical-align:bottom\" id=\"mwAlk\">\n<th id=\"mwAlo\">Location</th>\n<th id=\"mwAls\">Member</th>\n<th id=\"mwAlw\">Party</th>\n<th id=\"mwAl0\">First<br id=\"mwAl4\"/>elected</th>\n<th id=\"mwAl8\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cook_Partisan_Voting_Index\" title=\"Cook Partisan Voting Index\" id=\"mwAmA\">2026 PVI</a></th>\n<th id=\"mwAmE\">Trump margin of<br id=\"mwAmI\"/>victory in 2024</th>\n<th id=\"mwAmM\">Incumbent margin of<br id=\"mwAmQ\"/>victory in 2024</th></tr>\n<tr id=\"mwAmU\">\n<th id=\"mwAmY\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Maine's_2nd_congressional_district\" title=\"Maine's 2nd congressional district\" id=\"mwAmc\">Maine 2</a></th>\n<td id=\"mwAmg\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jared_Golden\" title=\"Jared Golden\" id=\"mwAmk\">Jared Golden</a><br id=\"mwAmo\"/><span style=\"font-size: 85%;\" about=\"#mwt401\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" id=\"mwAms\" data-mw='{\"parts\":[{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"small\",\"href\":\"./Template:Small\"},\"params\":{\"1\":{\"wt\":\"(retiring)\"}},\"i\":0}}]}'>(retiring)</span></td>\n<td style=\"color:black;background-color:#B0CEFF\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" about=\"#mwt402\" id=\"mwAmw\" data-mw='{\"parts\":[\"|\",{\"template\":{\"target\":{\"wt\":\"Party shading/Text/Democratic\",\"href\":\"./Template:Party_shading/Text/Democratic\"},\"params\":{},\"i\":0}}]}'>Democratic</td>\n<td id=\"mwAm0\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2018_United_States_House_of_Representatives_elections_in_Maine#District_2\